@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/catalog
Accept: application/json

### 2026 regular-season games
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/games?year=2026&competition=정규시즌
Accept: application/json

### Batter statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/batters?year=2026&competition=정규시즌
Accept: application/json

### Pitcher statistics
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/pitchers?year=2026&competition=정규시즌
Accept: application/json

### Player search
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players/search?q=이승현&limit=20
Accept: application/json

### Player page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players/51454
Accept: application/json

### Team catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teams
Accept: application/json

### Team page
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teams/SS
Accept: application/json
